  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project for the establishment of R&amp;D capability on Smart Multi-Microgrids for Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Equipment) Installing equipments of Smart Multi-Micro Grid R&amp;D lab and demonstration lab, (Dispatching Experts) Supporting Dispatching experts on Smart-grid and Building Energy Lab to consult and manage project, (Capacity Building) Capacity building by Join Research and Inviting training, (Monitoring &amp; Evaluation) Monitoring and Evaluation of Project</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to R&amp;D environment and strengthening research capacity in Morocco multi-micro grid area for achieving 52% renewable energy goal by 2030 among all the generators in Morocco&#xc2a4;&#xb9c8;&#xd2b8; &#xba40;&#xd2f0;&#xb9c8;&#xc774;&#xd06c;&#xb85c;&#xadf8;&#xb9ac;&#xb4dc;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; R&amp;D &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
